# retainer working state: created during work by the harness, guard and gate. There is nothing
# to version, and `git add -A` from the root would carry it into a commit and bring it back on every branch switch.
#
# A directory is written with a trailing slash: by this form the check against the kit asks git whether
# a path is covered. Negations and wildcards are not placed here — coverage is not asked for them.
.retainer/unlock
.retainer/bypass.log
.retainer/active-issue
.retainer/plan-checked
.retainer/guard_state/
.retainer/handoff.md
.claude/lock
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/guard_state/
.claude/worktrees/
# Derived: the code graph of older setups lived here; it now lives in the engine's state home.
graphify-out/
.DS_Store
